      "value": "Source: Global Market Proposition Overview (GE Final). 218 markets across 8 storefronts.\n\n**Terms of Trade key:**\n\n* **Domestic** — no messaging.\n* **Hidden DDP** — duties included, shown on PDP & in bag (International)\n* **DDP** — duties included, ZIMM checkout message only (Domestic)\n* **DDU** — duties excluded, customer pays on arrival.\n* **Disabled** — storefront not available in this market.\n\nAU — Domestic & International (20 markets)\n------------------------------------------\n\n| **Country** | **Terms of Trade** | **GE PDP & Cart** | **GE Checkout only** | **ZIMM Checkout only** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| American Samoa | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Australia (Default) | **Domestic** |  |  |  |\n| Cook Islands | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Fiji | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Guam | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Kiribati | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Marshall Islands | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Micronesia | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Nauru | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| New Caledonia | **DDP** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Included |\n| New Zealand | **DDP** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Included |\n| Niue | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Northern Mariana Islands | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Palau | **DDU** |  |  | Duties and Taxes are Excluded and May be payable at time of Arrival |\n| Papua New Guinea | **DDU** |  |  | Duties a