      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. Req ID prefix: **PRC**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | Comments | User Story Link |\n| PRC-01 | Price & Promotions | Price Feed & Pricebook Sync | The system will consume Fixed product pricing from AP21 via MuleSoft, including current selling price, original/RRP price, and markdown status, and map these to the appropriate SFCC pricebook fields. | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-01> |\n| PRC-02 | Price & Promotions | Price Feed & Pricebook Sync | The system will be able to ingest both a full and delta price feed from AP21 via MuleSoft | Dependent SF Functionality | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-02> |\n| PRC-03 | Price & Promotions | Price Feed & Pricebook Sync | The system will support future-dated markdown pricing activation via MuleSoft, including a date and time (not date only) so that sale pricing can be scheduled to go live at a precise datetime rather than just a calendar date. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Billy confirmed RRP based of timezones in AP21 will be live before SFCC - Mani confirmed MuleSoft/SFCC can support this | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-03> |\n| PRC-04 | Price & Promotions | Price Feed & Pricebook Sync | The system will support pricebooks for multiple currencies for each regional site in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-04> |\n| PRC-05 | Price & Promotions | Price Display & Tax | The system will display prices inclusive of tax on AU and EU sites (GST/VAT included); the same base price will be displayed across all EU countries with differing VAT rates handled in the background. | Accenture | AU, EU |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-05> |\n| PRC-06 | Price & Promotions | Price Display & Tax | The system will display prices exclusive of tax on the US site; tax will be calculated per state and displayed separately at checkout. | Accenture | US |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-06> |\n| PRC-07 | Price & Promotions | Price Display & Tax | The system will support bulk assignment of tax class to products | Accenture | UK | Config | Confirmed | This will come from Avalara will support AU, EU, US, UK Dom sites for go-live, the Intl sites (HK, ME, US Intl, EU Intl) supported through Global-e. Signing off on this basis. | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-07> |\n| PRC-08 | Price & Promotions | Price Display & Tax | The system will display product prices in the default currency configured for each regional SFCC site, consistently across PLP, PDP, mini-cart, cart, wishlist, recommended product tiles and checkout. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-08> |\n| PRC-09 | Price & Promotions | Sale & Markdown Pricing | The system will display the original list price alongside the active sale price when a sale pricebook entry is active; this will appear on product tiles (PLP), PDP, mini-bag, cart, checkout, wishlist, recommended product tiles and order history. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Sale items usually excluded from recommendations (manual rule) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-09> |\n| PRC-10 | Price & Promotions | Sale & Markdown Pricing | The system will allow business users to schedule sale pricing to go live at a specified future date and time | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-10> |\n| PRC-11 | Price & Promotions | Sale & Markdown Pricing | The system will support SFCC's native storefront preview capability, allowing business users to QC scheduled pricing and category changes before go-live, including preview for specific customer groups | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-11> |\n| PRC-12 | Price & Promotions | Sale & Markdown Pricing | The system will be able to flag items as final sale | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-12> |\n| PRC-13 | Price & Promotions | Sale & Markdown Pricing | The system will be able to support catalogue price markdowns from AP21 and promotions set up in SFCC. This should be reflected in order payload for accounting/reporting purposes. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | In MuleSoft session, when we discuss the payload, important to discuss the specification of the types of markdowns on the price and how this feeds into reporting in the ERP system | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-13> |\n| PRC-14 | Price & Promotions | Multi-Currency & Regional Pricebooks | The system will display a country/currency selector allowing the customer to indicate their shipping country; upon selection, the customer will see prices in the currency configured for their selected shipping country. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Country Selector not on AU site | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-14> |\n| PRC-15 | Price & Promotions | Cross-Border & Global-e | The system will support showing different duties paid messaging on PDP, depending on which duties + taxes model is relevant for the client's country.  The duties and taxes model is configurable per country | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-15> |\n| PRC-16 | Price & Promotions | Cross-Border & Global-e | The system will pass a complete cart to Global-e in the customer's selected target currency, including all line items, prices, promotions, rewards, gift card redemptions, and a placeholder/dummy shipping method. Global-e adds the actual shipping charges and processes payment in the customer's currency. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-16> |\n| PRC-17 | Price & Promotions | VIC & Customer Group Pricing | The system will support customer-group-specific catalogue pricing in SFCC, such that customers in a configured discount group see their discounted price consistently across PLP, PDP, mini-bag, cart, checkout, recommended product tiles and wishlist. Discounts will not apply to products already on sale or to gift cards. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-17> |\n| PRC-18 | Price & Promotions | Discount Stacking & Rules | The system will support configurable promotion stacking rules in SFCC Business Manager. Product, order, and shipping promotion types are stackable with each other. Within the same promotion type, only the highest discount will apply — discounts do not stack. Customer group discounts will prevail over sale pricing. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-18> |\n| PRC-19 | Price & Promotions | Discount Stacking & Rules | The system will support configurable priority rules for promotions in SFCC Business Manager (e.g. Gold VIC 10% discount excludes gift cards and items already on sale). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-19> |\n| PRC-20 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will allow business users to configure all promotions in SFCC Business Manager using the native Campaigns and Promotions module. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-20> |\n| PRC-21 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will support promotion scoping by: storefront (one, several, or all regional sites), customer group, product/category, and spend threshold. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-21> |\n| PRC-22 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will support coupon code generation in Business Manager: single-use unique codes and generic multi-use codes; bulk import of unique coupon codes via CSV must also be supported. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-22> |\n| PRC-23 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will allow a maximum of 1 promo code per cart. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-23> |\n| PRC-24 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will allow business users to set a maximum number of redemptions per promotion and per customer. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-24> |\n| PRC-25 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will support promotion scheduling with start and end dates/times, including time-zone awareness per storefront. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-25> |\n| PRC-26 | Price & Promotions | Promotions Engine | The system will support customer service teams creating one-off promotion codes (e.g. credit notes, shipping corrections) as backend promotions in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Audit / tracking needed | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-26> |\n| PRC-27 | Price & Promotions | Promotion Display | The system will display triggered promotions at line-item and/or order level at: mini-bag, cart, checkout, and order history. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-27> |\n| PRC-28 | Price & Promotions | Promotion Display | The system will pass applied promotion information to NewStore via MuleSoft as part of order placement | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-28> |\n| PRC-29 | Price & Promotions | Promotion Display | The system will display active promotion details and savings on the Cart/Bag page, including a banner confirming the applied promotion and an inline promotional code entry field with validation feedback (valid, invalid, expired, already redeemed). | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-29> |\n| PRC-30 | Price & Promotions | Promotion Display | The system will allow auto-applied promotions (e.g. free shipping, customer group discounts)to be applied silently on qualifying orders without requiring manual code entry. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-30> |\n| PRC-31 | Price & Promotions | Shipping Thresholds | The system will ensure free shipping thresholds will be evaluated on the post-discount cart total; a promotion discount can reduce an order below the free shipping threshold. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-31> |\n| PRC-32 | Price & Promotions | Retail Rewards | The system will ensure that retail rewards will be applied after promotion calculation, promotions are calculated first, then rewards are applied on top. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-32> |\n| PRC-33 | Price & Promotions | Price Feed & Pricebook Sync | The system will display product prices consistently across PLP, PDP, mini-bag, cart, wishlist, recommended product tiles, order history, and checkout. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-33> |\n| PRC-34 | Price & Promotions | AP21 Integration (Base) | The system will consume a base RRP pricebook per base currency (minimum: AUD, EUR, GBP, USD) from AP21 via MuleSoft into SFCC. Each base pricebook is the source of truth for prices in domestic markets and the calculation base for FX-derived international markets. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-34> |\n| PRC-35 | Price & Promotions | AP21 Integration (Fixed Pricelists) | The system will consume fixed pricelists per Global-e market from AP21 via MuleSoft into SFCC. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-35> |\n| PRC-36 | Price & Promotions | Country-Currency Mapping | The system will store the target currency that customers see for each shipping country. The country-to-currency mapping must be configurable in SFCC without code deployment. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-36> |\n| PRC-37 | Price & Promotions | Currency Conversion Approach | The system will store, per currency, the conversion approach used to derive that currency's price from the storefront's base pricebook: (a) Base RRP (no conversion — currency matches storefront base), (b) Fixed Pricelist (currency price loaded directly from AP21), (c) Fixed FX rate from base (base price multiplied by a configured fixed FX rate), (d) Dynamic FX rate from base (base price multiplied by the nightly FX rate). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-37> |\n| PRC-38 | Price & Promotions | Global-e FX + Pricing Job | The system will run a job nightly to load Global-e pricing into SFCC, including currency FX rates, price coefficients, and rounding rules. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-38> |\n| PRC-39 | Price & Promotions | Global-e FX + Pricing Job | The system will generate pricebooks from the loaded Global-e pricing data and import them into SFCC | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-39> |\n| PRC-40 | Price & Promotions | Price Calculation | The system will calculate target-currency prices for FX-derived markets using the formula: base pricebook price × FX rate × country coefficient × product-class coefficient. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-40> |\n| PRC-41 | Price & Promotions | Search Index | The system will include calculated target-currency prices in the SFCC search index so that price-based filters and sort options on PLP and search results work correctly per ship-to country / currency. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-41> |\n| PRC-42 | Price & Promotions | Promotion Calculation Currency | The system will execute all promotion calculations in the customer's selected ship-to currency. Promotions configured as percentage discounts apply post-conversion; promotions configured as fixed amounts must be defined per currency or use a base-currency equivalent with a documented rounding rule. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-42> |\n| PRC-43 | Price & Promotions | Cart Handoff to Global-e | The system will send a complete cart from SFCC to Global-e in the customer's target currency for international checkout, including line items with quantities, prices in target currency, all applied promotions and coupon codes, retail rewards, gift cards, and shipping method. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed | **Open question** on whether global-e can support catalogue promotions in SFCC cartridge at the time of checkout | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-43> |\n| PRC-44 | Price & Promotions | Gift Cards — Global-e | The system will expose webhooks to support Global-e's use of gift cards, including validating, redeeming, and refunding. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-44> |\n| PRC-45 | Price & Promotions | Retail Rewards — Global-e | The system will support customer redemption of retail rewards at Global-e checkout for international markets. A maximum of one retail reward can be applied per order. Rewards are applied after promotions. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed | **Change in requirement comment**: Multiple retail rewards can be applied per order.  For retail rewards - plan does not include third party retail rewards. We assume the rewards points are from AP21 | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-45> |\n| PRC-46 | Price & Promotions | Coupon Handling — Global-e | The system will pass applied coupon codes and discount values to Global-e as part of the cart payload at international checkout. Global-e will not call back to SFCC to validate coupons — validation has already taken place in SFCC. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed | **Open question** on whether global-e can support coupon code application | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-46> |\n| PRC-47 | Price & Promotions | Currency Display Formatting | The system will format price display per locale: currency symbol position, decimal places (including zero-decimal currencies e.g. JPY, KRW, VND, IDR), thousand separator, and minus-sign placement for refunds/credits. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-47> |\n| PRC-48 | Price & Promotions | FX Refund Rate Lock | The system will lock the FX rate used at order placement and apply that same locked rate to refunds (full or partial), regardless of FX rate changes between order and refund. Refund value in target currency must equal the original charged amount in target currency. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-48> |\n| PRC-49 | Price & Promotions | Currency Rounding Strategy | The system will apply a defined rounding strategy per currency on FX conversion (e.g. round to nearest whole AED, round to 2 decimal places EUR, round to 0 decimal places JPY). Rounding rule configurable per currency. Rounding applied at line-item level before tax/promotion stacking. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-49> |\n| PRC-50 | Price & Promotions | BM Admin — Currency Configuration | The system will provide a Business Manager interface where authorised users (role-controlled) can: (a) view the conversion approach configured for each currency — Base / Fixed Pricelist / Fixed FX from base / Dynamic FX from base; (b) set or change the conversion approach for a currency without code deployment; (c) view the current FX rate per currency from the latest Global-e nightly feed, including last-updated timestamp and feed status (success / stale / failed). Read-only access available for non-power users (e.g. merchandising team) via SFCC role permissions. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-50> |\n| PRC-51 | Price & Promotions | Bulk Import/Export — Technical | The system will support bulk import and export of currency configuration (conversion approach, per-currency settings, and rounding rules) by technical users only, via SFCC Site Import/Export, OCAPI, or deployment scripts. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-51> |\n| PRC-52 | Price & Promotions | BM Admin — Country-Currency Mapping | The system will provide a Business Manager interface where authorised users (role-controlled) can: (a) view the target currency configured for each shipping country, (b) set or change the country-to-currency mapping for a country without code deployment, (c) view a complete list of all configured shipping countries and their currencies. Read-only access available for non-power users via SFCC role permissions. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-52> |\n| PRC-53 | Price & Promotions | Gift Card Purchase — Global-e | The system will support customers purchasing Givex gift cards as products at Global-e checkout for international markets. After successful payment, the gift card is provisioned in Givex via the existing middleware integration. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed | **Open question** on whether global-e regions (digital) gift cards in all currencies are supported? | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-53> |\n| PRC-54 | Price & Promotions | Global-e Catalog Feed | The system will run a daily Global-e export job to generate and upload a product catalog CSV to Global-e via SFTP, to enable Global-e to apply product-level restrictions, country-specific VAT rates, and HS code assignments. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-54> |\n| PRC-55 | Price & Promotions | Authentication — SFCC to Global-e | The system will configure authentication between SFCC and Global-e to secure all API calls between the two platforms. | Accenture | Global-e markets | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20PRC-55> |",
