    },
    "version": 3,
    "attachments": [
      {
        "id": "att491814940",
        "type": "attachment",
        "status": "current",
        "title": "region.png",
        "media_type": "application/octet-stream",
        "file_size": 30709,
        "download_url": "/rest/api/content/491126816/child/attachment/att491814940/download"
      }
    ],
    "content": {
      "value": "Description\n-----------\n\n**Region** is one entry per SFCC storefront/region — the canonical, referenceable region entity. Any content type needing region-scoping (links, footer config, header nav, UI copy, etc.) references this via a `regions` field, rather than duplicating a hardcoded site-ID list. The single most-referenced primitive by count of distinct referencing models (see the master diagram's red lines on [5.9.2](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/465240068) — [Footer Config](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/491782157), [Header Navigation](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/490176517), [Header Nav Item](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/491552785), [UI Copy](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/491782178), and [Link](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/491716614) all reference it).\n\nOne of the four foundational \"Shared building blocks already in place\" on 5.9.2. No Figma/Magento screenshot section; field values below come from the real Storybook fixture in `overrides/app/components/footer/index.stories.content.ts`.\n\n**Backs:** region-scoped precedence resolution everywhere it's used — see `overrides/app/utils/resolveByRegion.ts`.\n\nConcept of the model design\n---------------------------\n\nnoneRegion (entry)\nsiteId: \"ZimmermannAU\" — canonical join key, matches an SFCC site ID from\noverrides/app/config/contentfulMapping.generated.ts's SITE\\_LOCALES keys\nlabel: \"Australia\" — editor-facing display name, not shopper-facing copy\nlocale: \"en\" — informational only, mirrors the site's primary locale\n\nModel fields\n------------\n\n![download](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/491126816/child/attachment/att491814940/download)\n\n| Field | Type | Example |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `siteId` | Short text, required, unique — the canonical join key against SFCC's own site IDs | \"ZimmermannAU\" |\n| `label` | Short text, required — admin/editor label, not shopper-facing | \"Australia\" |\n| `locale` | Short text, optional — informational only, helps an editor sanity-check they picked the right region when selecting a reference | \"en\" |\n\nOpen items\n----------\n\n* Only one real Region fixture exists in the repo (`ZimmermannAU`) — the other 7 SFCC sites (US domestic, US international, UK, EU domestic, EU international, HK, ME — see AGENTS.md's Multi-site & Routing section) have no fixture entries yet to confirm `siteId` naming matches `SITE_LOCALES` exactly for each.",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "1f30f",
    "page_width": "full-width"
  }
}"}

